{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/about_WelcomeToVaifurion.png?t=1744353740\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cozy blend of idle progression, card collecting, and RPG mechanics. Click, collect, and unlock <strong>over 1,000 </strong>beautifully illustrated waifu cards, some with stunning <strong>holographic effects</strong> while enjoying a <strong>chill, ambient experience.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/about_Game_Features.png?t=1744353740\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle &amp; Active Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click your way to progress, or let the game unfold automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1,000+ Collectible Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Holographic effects, multiple rarities, and full collection tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lootbox System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open Basic, Mystic, Celestial, and Ethereal lootboxes to uncover cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For both casual collectors and completionists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing &amp; Stylish UI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy smooth animations, ambient effects, and a cozy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ Custom Music Tracks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To set a certain mood and tone to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2756 <strong>Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate card-collecting adventure!\u00a0</strong>\u2756</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563130?t=1744353740","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35631