nd Ethereal lootboxes to uncover cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For both casual collectors and completionists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing &amp; Stylish UI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy smooth animations, ambient effects, and a cozy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ Custom Music Tracks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To set a certain mood and tone to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2756 <strong>Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate card-collecting adventure!\u00a0</strong>\u2756</p>","developers":["Nightspire Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/fd31cd20a9856b38cf691604cfcbb62c27bf033a/header.jpg?t=1744353740","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Nightspire Games. All rights reserved. Vaifurion\u2122 and all related content are trademarks of Nightspire Games.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Vaifurion \u2013 Idle Waifu CCG","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU (Intel HD or better)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or Ryzen 5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU for smoother animations<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Nightspire Games"],"ratings":{"dejus"